            "kira_final": "The OCR of the pseudocode image revealed the logic:\n1. Read the image file bytes\n2. Compute `h0 = sha256(img_bytes)`\n3. Compute `H = sha256(h0 + h0[:10] + SALT)` where SALT = \"0000TBENCH-SALT\"\n4. Print the hex digest\n\nThe computed hash starts with `bee26a` as expected, and the result has been written to `/app/output.txt`.",
